{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/Bum_FIghts_Title_Steam_Outer_Glow.png?t=1736402277\" /><br><br>Get ready to brawl like never before in <strong>Bum Fights!</strong> Jump into the ultimate online multiplayer top-down shooter set in a nostalgic medieval world, where you rise from rags to riches as a penniless warrior fighting for survival and glory.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/Bum_Fights_Battle_Gif.gif?t=1736402277\" /><br><br>Experience fast-paced action and intense combat as you battle other players in the arena, or team up to take on hordes of the undead. Arm yourself with a variety of weapons, from rusty knives to throwing rocks, and fight until you're the last one standing.<br><br><strong>BEWARE!</strong> The competition is fierce, and only the strongest and most skilled will emerge victorious. With customizable characters and diverse game modes, every battle brings a new challenge.<br><br>Gear up for battle and enter the arena to prove your worth as the Lord of the Bums!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/FAST_PACED_ARENA_ACTION.png?t=1736402277\" /><br>Master the arena in explosive battles of reaction and skill. Choose your warrior, team up with friends, and dive into combat - for glory awaits only those who seek it.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/FIGHTGIF-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1736402277\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/SCAVENGE_FOR_LOOT.png?t=1736402277\" /><br>Scavenge the battlefield for loot to turn the tide of battle. Equip yourself with a fearsome arsenal of weapons, from tomatoes to shields and swords. Be sure to stay stocked with health potions to keep your fighting spirit alive and dominate your enemies.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/Loot_Pick_Up_Gif.gif?t=1736402277\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/TACTICAL_COMBAT.png?t=1736402277\" /><br>Aim skill shots and dodge projectiles using WASD movement and cursor-based aiming. Outwit your opponents with precise attacks and tactical decisions to gain the upper hand in combat.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/WEAPONSGIF-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1736402277\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/FIGHT_THE_UNDEAD.png?t=1736402277\" /><br>Face relentless waves of zombies in thrilling co-op battles. Team up with fellow warriors to survive the onslaught and prove your mettle against the undead.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/ZOMBIEGIF-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1736402277\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/CUSTOMIZE_YOUR_BUM.png?t=1736402277\" /><br>Show off your style with customizable options for hairstyle, hair color, skin color, and gender. Stand out from the crowd and make your mark on the battlefield.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/CUSTOMBUM-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1736402277\" /><br><br>Gear up for battle and enter the arena to prove your worth as the Lord of the Bums!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2347860?t=1736402277","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1736402277","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1736402277","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1736402277","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Rated M \u2013 Mature content that may be suitable for persons ages 17 and older. May contain violence and/or strong language."},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/Bum_FIghts_Title_Steam_Outer_Glow.png?t=1736402277\" /><br><br>Get ready to brawl like never before in <strong>Bum Fights!</strong> Jump into the ultimate online multiplayer top-down shooter set in a nostalgic medieval world, where you rise from rags to riches as a penniless warrior fighting for survival and glory.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/Bum_Fights_Battle_Gif.gif?t=1736402277\" /><br><br>Experience fast-paced action and intense combat as you battle other players in the arena, or team up to take on hordes of the undead. Arm yourself with a variety of weapons, from rusty knives to throwing rocks, and fight until you're the last one standing.<br><br><strong>BEWARE!</strong> The competition is fierce, and only the strongest and most skilled will emerge victorious. With customizable characters and diverse game modes, every battle brings a new challenge.<br><br>Gear up for battle and enter the arena to prove your worth as the Lord of the Bums!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/FAST_PACED_ARENA_ACTION.png?t=1736402277\" /><br>Master the arena in explosive battles of reaction and skill. Choose your warrior, team up with friends, and dive into combat - for glory awaits only those who seek it.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/FIGHTGIF-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1736402277\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/SCAVENGE_FOR_LOOT.png?t=1736402277\" /><br>Scavenge the battlefield for loot to turn the tide of battle. Equip yourself with a fearsome arsenal of weapons, from tomatoes to shields and swords. Be sure to stay stocked with health potions to keep your fighting spirit alive and dominate your enemies.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/Loot_Pick_Up_Gif.gif?t=1736402277\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/TACTICAL_COMBAT.png?t=1736402277\" /><br>Aim skill shots and dodge projectiles using WASD movement and cursor-based aiming. Outwit your opponents with precise attacks and tactical decisions to gain the upper hand in combat.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/WEAPONSGIF-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1736402277\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/FIGHT_THE_UNDEAD.png?t=1736402277\" /><br>Face relentless waves of zombies in thrilling co-op battles. Team up with fellow warriors to survive the onslaught and prove your mettle against the undead.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/ZOMBIEGIF-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1736402277\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/CUSTOMIZE_YOUR_BUM.png?t=1736402277\" /><br>Show off your style with customizable options for hairstyle, hair color, skin color, and gender. Stand out from the crowd and make your mark on the battlefield.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/extras/CUSTOMBUM-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1736402277\" /><br><br>Gear up for battle and enter the arena to prove your worth as the Lord of the Bums!","developers":["Sick Fish"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347860/header.jpg?t=1736402277","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257037809,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257037809/movie480.mp4?t=1722299450","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257037809/movie_max.mp4?t=1722299450"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257037809/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1722299450","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257037809/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1722299450","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257037809/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1722299450"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257036776,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257036776/movie480.mp4?t=1721231035","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257036776/movie_max.mp4?t=1721231035"},"name":"Bum Fights Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257036776/movie.293x165